              "type": "string",
              "value": "## information\nPerson Name: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.personName}}\nCurrent Job Title: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.businessTitle}} \nCompany Name: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.legalEmployerName}} \nAdditional context: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.userInput}} \nDepartment name: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.departmentName}} \n\n## instructions\nYour task is to assist an employee in writing a description to add to an  \"About Me\" section in a corporate directory using the information above.\nIf the text provided as additional context contains information that's not relevant to an \"About Me\" section or is inappropriate for a workplace, ignore that information while generating the response.\nThe length of the description should be no more than 100 words.\nWrite the summary in first person."
            }
